<h1 id="the-evil-circle-magnified">The evil circle, magnified</h1>

<p>First we take a closer look at our acquaintaince, the evil circle of grants and papers. It’s pretty simple. It’s a vicious circle where it’s difficult to enter, but once you are inside, then it can really bring you in an upward spyral of outstanding achievements. Well, until you keep feeding it anyway. So let’s start somewhere, maybe with the <em>grant money</em>.</p>

